{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4qAsGaSay8n8ZANiYu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A heavy oak door stands before you, ancient and weathered. Iron studs dot its surface in patterns that might be constellations — or might be warnings. The wood grain swirls like frozen smoke.*\n\n**🔒 LOCKED**\n\n*A rusted iron keyhole stares at you like a single unblinking eye. The mechanism within clicks and shifts restlessly, as if something alive turns the tumblers from the other side.*\n\n*Cold air seeps through the gap beneath. From beyond, you hear... nothing. The specific, deliberate nothing that happens when something has just stopped making noise.*\n\n*The door does not want to open.*\n*The door does not want to stay closed.*\n*The door waits.*\n\n**> WHAT DO YOU DO?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":172,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}